  truth: "The app's own checks — invariants, consistency, discrepancies — run on the live data every morning, with a trend, so drift shows before the floor finds it.",
  live: "Who is signed in now, on which device, which screen, and their last action.",
  releases: "Which build each device is on, what changed in each build, the minimum-version switch, and one-tap roll back to the previous build.",
  alerts: "Straight to your phone: a change the cloud refused, labels stuck more than 10 minutes, a device offline since yesterday, an order due tomorrow not packed.",
